# ==============================================================================
# KIOT FEST - ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION TEMPLATE
# ==============================================================================
# NOTE FOR VERCEL DEPLOYMENT:
# 1. OPTIONAL: If you DO NOT provide these variables in Vercel, the app automatically 
#    runs in In-Memory Mock Mode (zero setup, pre-seeded events & tickets work out-of-the-box).
# 2. If you want persistent cloud storage, provide a cloud MySQL service 
#    (e.g., Aiven, Railway, Supabase, or AWS RDS) and paste these in Vercel Project Settings:

MYSQL_HOST=your-cloud-mysql-host.example.com
MYSQL_USER=your_db_username
MYSQL_PASSWORD=your_db_password
MYSQL_DATABASE=kiot_fest_db
MYSQL_PORT=3306
